{"id":"n59892-2-8","stage":4,"title":"부패 · 腐朽","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59892-2-8-1","ko":"어떤 고등학교 교사가 학부모한테 돈을 받았다며?","zh":"听说有某所高中的老师收了家长的钱？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떤","meaning":"某个","explanation":"어떤：某个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"3","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"고등학교","meaning":"高中","explanation":"고등학교：高中","readings":[{"term":"고등학교","audio":"/audio/1920aafc68961592e642.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23380","senseId":"1","lemma":"고등학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고등학교","audio":"/audio/1920aafc68961592e642.mp3"}},{"text":"교사가","meaning":"教师","explanation":"교사：教师；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"교사","audio":"/audio/df8671acdd670935b501.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24037","senseId":"1","lemma":"교사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교사가","audio":"/audio/39b27778d485783458a4.mp3"}},{"text":"학부모한테","meaning":"家长，学生家长","explanation":"학부모：家长，学生家长；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"학부모","audio":"/audio/fa3458e14bb2c096b931.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84357","senseId":"1","lemma":"학부모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학부모한테","audio":"/audio/60d4dccf701392050f7b.mp3"}},{"text":"돈을","meaning":"钱，金钱，钱币","explanation":"돈：钱，金钱，钱币；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"돈","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17204","senseId":"1","lemma":"돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돈을","audio":"/audio/658b47180707ddf8eb38.mp3"}},{"text":"받았다며?","meaning":"收，收取，征收","explanation":"받다：收，收取，征收；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"2","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받았다며","audio":"/audio/17d82a46d7046519a30f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"某个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"没有必要明确地指出是哪个对象时使用的话。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"1920aafc68961592","term":"고등학교","zh":"高中","audio":"/audio/1920aafc68961592e642.mp3","entryId":"23380","definition":"具有初中毕业水平的学历或初中毕业后可以去的学校。","pronunciation":["고등학꾜"]},{"id":"df8671acdd670935","term":"교사","zh":"教师","audio":"/audio/df8671acdd670935b501.mp3","entryId":"24037","definition":"在幼儿园、小学、初中和高中等学校具备资格教授学生的人。","pronunciation":["교ː사"]},{"id":"fa3458e14bb2c096","term":"학부모","zh":"家长，学生家长","audio":"/audio/fa3458e14bb2c096b931.mp3","entryId":"84357","definition":"学生的父母。","pronunciation":["학뿌모"]},{"id":"a5d79d1c30059080","term":"돈","zh":"钱，金钱，钱币","audio":"/audio/a5d79d1c3005908084a4.mp3","entryId":"17204","definition":"买卖商品或作为劳动代价支付或收取的硬币或纸币。","pronunciation":["돈ː"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"收，收取，征收","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"收下他人上缴的钱或东西。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/51185bb067555d032c58.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59892-2-8-2","ko":"응, 교육 기관에 부패가 있으면 안 되는데 말이야.","zh":"对啊，教育机构里可不能存在腐败行为啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"교육","meaning":"教育，培训","explanation":"교육：教育，培训","readings":[{"term":"교육","audio":"/audio/4da9a75910ede3adef01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55289","senseId":"1","lemma":"교육","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"교육","audio":"/audio/4da9a75910ede3adef01.mp3"}},{"text":"기관에","meaning":"机关","explanation":"기관：机关；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"기관","audio":"/audio/5d78ce2d4d5f697d5065.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32482","senseId":"2","lemma":"기관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기관에","audio":"/audio/75c8c8596afeb8216870.mp3"}},{"text":"부패가","meaning":"腐朽，腐败","explanation":"부패：腐朽，腐败；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"부패","audio":"/audio/3b08ca7ba3c3b8b80451.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59892","senseId":"2","lemma":"부패","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"부패가","audio":"/audio/8fe5ebc39a382b2ca7a7.mp3"}},{"text":"있으면","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으면","audio":"/audio/909011195908a586359d.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"되는데","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"20","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되는데","audio":"/audio/40919078d70adde66cd7.mp3"}},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。","explanation":"말：表示引发注意或结束句子时使用的词汇。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"11","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이야","audio":"/audio/fd5a3f00cd7342725148.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audi